{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Don\u2019t trust the butcher&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Butcher's Village\u2122&quot;\u00a0</strong>is a first-person psychological horror game with a heavy focus on atmosphere and disorientation. You play as Murtaza, a man who arrives in a remote village in North America where nothing feels quite right. The people are strange, and the endless heavy rain turns every step into a struggle. The deeper you go, the more the world around you begins to fracture and distort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>IMPORTANT NOTE: The game focuses on exploration and builds tension slowly to create a deeper and more meaningful experience. Its story is unveiled through surreal imaging and subtle environment details. Be mindful that it is a difficult game in unconventional ways.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/8e98badc1e73ea026e1cf5ab0f97fe27.poster.avif?t=1764247711\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/8e98badc1e73ea026e1cf5ab0f97fe27.webm?t=1764247711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/8e98badc1e73ea026e1cf5ab0f97fe27.mp4?t=1764247711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORYLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man named Murtaza lives in North America. One rainy evening, he receives a call from his friend, urgently asking him to come to a certain address and help with a troubling situation. Without hesitation, Murtaza gets into his car and drives into the heavy rain. The road is swallowed by thick fog, and the downpour makes it nearly impossible to see. Suddenly, an accident occurs as his car skids and crashes. When he regains consciousness, the vehicle is wrecked and refuses to start. Stranded in the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains flashing lights, rapid visual effects, and intense imagery that may trigger seizures or other adverse reactions in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy or similar conditions. Player discretion is advised.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/b406a49bb8099bbae774c10030a34652.poster.avif?t=1764247711\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/b406a49bb8099bbae774c10030a34652.webm?t=1764247711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/b406a49bb8099bbae774c10030a34652.mp4?t=1764247711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanity</strong> \u2013 unravels as familiar places shift into bizarre visions, leaving you unsure of what can be trusted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Horror</strong> \u2013 Heavy story focused and the game atmosphere surround you with tension and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Butcher\u2019s Legacy</strong> \u2013 A merciless figure whose presence is felt in every corner, through bloodstained tools, broken memory, and traces of his crimes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Fear</strong> \u2013 What looks ordinary at first slowly changes into something you can\u2019t explain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Design \u2013</strong> Immersive audio wraps around you, raising the tension and slowly drawing you into madness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/a0270f1f71188cef692d4b1ede45df71.poster.avif?t=1764247711\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/a0270f1f71188cef692d4b1ede45df71.webm?t=1764247711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/a0270f1f71188cef692d4b1ede45df71.mp4?t=1764247711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIS KNIFE, YOUR FEAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No escape from his watch \u2014 every step closer to the truth makes his presence sharper, the blood heavier, and the bodies a grim reminder of the butcher\u2019s mess left behind.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033710?t=1764247711","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/f7bad854cc92fae05c307a2396304d634f8aa0fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764247711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/ac8b755e2bad92265272a1d0b77f7682f1